#: ../../source/docs/loading-the-firmware.rst:5
#: db70f268f66440f3a23dab783e4532bc
msgid "Loading the Firmware"
msgstr "刷写固件"

#: ../../source/docs/loading-the-firmware.rst:7
#: 270f1d8bd8d74433b013bfa2e1ca5b30
msgid ""
"Before loading Firmware, you need to choose which :ref:`autopilot hardware "
"<common-autopilots>` to use. All supported autopilots are suitable for use "
"with AntennaTracker. The antenna tracker firmware can be loaded from the "
"Mission Planner's **Setup \\| Install Firmware** very :ref:`much like any "
"other vehicle <common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk>` if ArduPilot firmware "
"is already loaded."
msgstr ""
"刷固件之前，请先选择要使用的 :ref:`飞控硬件 <common-autopilots>`。所有受支持的飞控都可用于 "
"AntennaTracker。如果板上已经装有 ArduPilot 固件，AntennaTracker 固件可通过 Mission Planner 的 "
"**Setup | Install Firmware** 刷写，:ref:`方式与其他载具基本相同 <common-loading-firmware-"
"onto-pixhawk>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/loading-the-firmware.rst:15
#: 6bb0adae0fdf4e619d876ef9bf6dc953
msgid ""
"Connect the flight control board to the computer using the mini USB cable"
msgstr "使用 mini USB 线将飞控板连接到电脑"

#: ../../source/docs/loading-the-firmware.rst:16
#: e3ff65dfa52242259f0a9784e2485e56
msgid ""
"Select the appropriate COM port on the top right of the screen but do not "
"push the Connect button"
msgstr "在界面右上角选择对应 COM 口，但先不要按 Connect 按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/loading-the-firmware.rst:18
#: 308f906ccead419ab4e4ef004ebb4f0a
msgid ""
"From the **Initial Setup \\| Install Firmware** page click on the \"Antenna "
"Tracker\" icon on the bottom left.  Follow any instructions that appear and "
"after a minute or so the firmware should be uploaded and you should be able "
"to connect with the mission planner and see the Flight Data screen's HUD "
"update."
msgstr ""
"在 **Initial Setup | Install Firmware** 页面点击左下方的「Antenna "
"Tracker」图标。按提示操作，约一分钟后固件应该已上传完毕，便可在 Mission Planner 中连接并看到 Flight Data 页面 "
"HUD 刷新。"

#: ../../source/docs/loading-the-firmware.rst:24
#: 32158d0b16ed45929b880cb84fa8a0b5
msgid ""
"If non-ArduPilot firmware is loaded on the autopilot, see :ref:`these "
"instructions <common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards>` for "
"instructions to download a version of antennatracker_with_bl.hex firmware "
"and install."
msgstr ""
"如果飞控上当前装的不是 ArduPilot 固件，请参见 :ref:`这些说明 <common-loading-firmware-onto-"
"chibios-only-boards>` 下载并安装一份带 bootloader 的 antennatracker_with_bl.hex 固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/loading-the-firmware.rst:28
#: 077f84ea9c0b4a248c2ce91025c9f834
msgid ""
"Because the EEPROM format is different between the Antenna Tracker firmware "
"and any flight controller software that was previously installed on the "
"board (i.e. Copter or Plane) it is likely the EEPROM will have been erased "
"by the firmware upload."
msgstr ""
"由于 AntennaTracker 固件与板上原来其他飞控软件（如 Copter 或 Plane）的 EEPROM 格式不同，刷新固件后 EEPROM "
"很可能被擦除。"
